WEBVTT

00:00:09.414 --> 00:00:10.415
[Eret] Drago!

00:00:10.498 --> 00:00:11.499
[groans]

00:00:14.753 --> 00:00:16.129
Get off me!

00:00:16.796 --> 00:00:20.634
[Eret chuckles]
Always great to see you, my friend!

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.385
Keeping warm up here?

00:00:25.472 --> 00:00:28.808
Well, as you can see, I'm right on time

00:00:28.892 --> 00:00:30.393
with a new batch of dragons,

00:00:30.518 --> 00:00:31.728
just like I promised.

00:00:31.895 --> 00:00:33.521
[man] He's waking up!

00:00:33.813 --> 00:00:34.898
Give me some backup, here!

00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:38.109
Drop the ropes!

00:00:41.071 --> 00:00:42.239
[snarls]

00:00:51.748 --> 00:00:53.124
Huh.

00:00:56.044 --> 00:00:57.462
[yelling]

00:01:03.969 --> 00:01:05.595
[growling softly]

00:01:06.972 --> 00:01:08.598
[moans]

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:12.602
-[Snotlout] Hookfang!
-[Ruffnut] Hey!

00:01:12.769 --> 00:01:14.104
What are you doing?

00:01:14.396 --> 00:01:18.108
You belong to me now.

00:01:18.191 --> 00:01:19.401
[men laughing]

00:01:19.484 --> 00:01:21.403
[Eret] And as an added bonus…

00:01:21.611 --> 00:01:23.488
I also caught you their riders.

00:01:23.697 --> 00:01:25.782
-No extra charge.
-What?

00:01:25.949 --> 00:01:27.284
-Are you kidding me?
-Aw!

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.286
But you were so perfect!

00:01:29.452 --> 00:01:31.788
Turns out, there is
a whole bunch of them out there.

00:01:33.039 --> 00:01:34.249
[choking]

00:01:34.457 --> 00:01:35.500
How many?

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:37.460
Drago doesn't have them after all.

00:01:37.877 --> 00:01:39.379
-How many?
-[Astrid] Hundreds.

00:01:39.546 --> 00:01:41.006
A whole island full!

00:01:41.381 --> 00:01:43.008
[coughing] I wouldn't worry about it.

00:01:43.174 --> 00:01:46.303
[choking] My men are
hunting them down as we speak.

00:01:46.469 --> 00:01:49.306
They won't know
where you're hiding, I promise you that.

00:01:49.472 --> 00:01:51.516
Yes, they will. They know we're missing,

00:01:51.683 --> 00:01:53.643
and they have tracking dragons.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:56.229
If you so much as touch us,
Hiccup is gonna kick--

00:01:56.313 --> 00:01:58.273
-Hiccup?
-[Eret] He's not a problem.

00:01:58.356 --> 00:02:00.317
Really. Trust me.

00:02:00.483 --> 00:02:02.652
He's only the son of Stoick the Vast,

00:02:02.736 --> 00:02:04.529
his heir to the throne of Berk,

00:02:04.696 --> 00:02:08.199
and the greatest dragon master
this world has ever seen!

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:10.243
Dragon master?

00:02:10.368 --> 00:02:13.830
I alone control the dragons!

00:02:13.997 --> 00:02:15.832
-No. Mmm-mmm.
-Sorry.

00:02:16.458 --> 00:02:19.586
And unless you let us go, right now,

00:02:19.836 --> 00:02:22.088
he will blast through here
on his Night Fury

00:02:22.213 --> 00:02:25.342
and blow your
entire fleet of ships to splinters.

00:02:25.425 --> 00:02:27.010
Then they will be crying like babies.

00:02:27.093 --> 00:02:28.094
[boys laughing]

00:02:28.178 --> 00:02:29.220
Funny and beautiful.

00:02:29.346 --> 00:02:30.347
Good one, babe!

00:02:30.638 --> 00:02:31.681
[Ruffnut groans]

00:02:31.765 --> 00:02:33.183
Like babies, they always cry.

00:02:33.266 --> 00:02:34.559
Real tiny ones.

00:02:34.684 --> 00:02:39.230
First, there was one rider,
and now, all of Berk.

00:02:40.023 --> 00:02:42.442
And you led them to me!

00:02:43.735 --> 00:02:44.778
[grunts] Drago!

00:02:44.861 --> 00:02:47.405
Stop all preparations!

00:02:47.572 --> 00:02:51.659
We must attack
the dragon riders' nest at once!

00:02:51.826 --> 00:02:55.455
We will take down their alpha!

00:02:55.622 --> 00:02:59.042
Then we will take Berk!

00:02:59.125 --> 00:03:00.293
[men cheering]

00:03:00.794 --> 00:03:01.836
Drago.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.421
And get rid of him.

00:03:04.214 --> 00:03:06.216
Oh, Drago, please, I…

00:03:11.429 --> 00:03:12.639
[Astrid] Stormfly!

00:03:15.934 --> 00:03:17.143
Hmm.

00:03:17.227 --> 00:03:18.645
No! [grunts]

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.859
[dragons screeching]

00:03:30.365 --> 00:03:32.700
Well, bud, we can't wait around

00:03:32.784 --> 00:03:35.245
for Drago to attack this place.

00:03:35.412 --> 00:03:36.955
We've gotta find him first.

00:03:39.207 --> 00:03:40.708
[growls]

00:03:41.459 --> 00:03:42.877
[chomping]

00:03:44.671 --> 00:03:46.381
Let's go. [muffled gasp]

00:03:47.674 --> 00:03:49.134
Easy now.

00:03:49.217 --> 00:03:51.136
Are you kidding me?
How did you get in here?

00:03:51.219 --> 00:03:52.804
The same way we are getting you out.

00:03:52.887 --> 00:03:54.472
-We?
-All clear.

00:03:54.639 --> 00:03:55.682
Toothless, come.

00:03:55.932 --> 00:03:58.685
Wait. There's something you need to know.

00:03:58.768 --> 00:04:00.520
[Stoick] Yeah, yeah, tell me on the way.

00:04:00.603 --> 00:04:03.148
This isn't an on-the-way
kind of update, actually.

00:04:03.273 --> 00:04:04.441
I've heard enough.

00:04:04.524 --> 00:04:07.152
More of the
earth-shattering-development variety.

00:04:07.318 --> 00:04:09.404
Yeah, just add it to the pile.

00:04:09.696 --> 00:04:10.905
[Hiccup stuttering]

00:04:10.989 --> 00:04:15.118
Dad, unlike most surprises I spring on
you, this is one you'll like.

00:04:15.201 --> 00:04:16.244
I promise.

00:04:16.369 --> 00:04:18.371
You just have to handle it delicately.

00:04:18.455 --> 00:04:19.581
So…

00:04:21.749 --> 00:04:25.253
You might want to take this one.

00:04:25.336 --> 00:04:26.337
Huh?

00:04:27.422 --> 00:04:28.673
Oh, boy.

00:04:29.174 --> 00:04:30.383
Oh. Uh…

00:04:30.467 --> 00:04:31.468
Dad,

00:04:31.551 --> 00:04:34.053
could you put the sword away, please?

00:04:34.888 --> 00:04:35.930
[gasps]

00:04:36.014 --> 00:04:37.474
Oh.

00:04:40.894 --> 00:04:42.395
[sword clangs]

00:04:46.065 --> 00:04:49.027
I know what you're gonna say, Stoick.

00:04:49.944 --> 00:04:51.946
How could I have done this?

00:04:53.156 --> 00:04:54.908
Stayed away all of these years?

00:04:55.074 --> 00:04:56.993
And why did I not come back to you?

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.037
To our son?

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.330
Well…

00:05:00.413 --> 00:05:04.000
What sign did I have
that you could change, Stoick?

00:05:04.167 --> 00:05:06.169
That anyone on Berk could?

00:05:06.961 --> 00:05:10.340
I pleaded so many times
to stop the fighting,

00:05:10.507 --> 00:05:13.009
to find another answer,
but did any of you listen?

00:05:13.176 --> 00:05:15.011
This is why I never married.

00:05:15.178 --> 00:05:17.764
This and one other reason.

00:05:18.681 --> 00:05:22.143
I know that I left you
to raise Hiccup alone,

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:24.979
but I thought he would be
better off without me.

00:05:25.396 --> 00:05:28.525
And I was wrong, I see that now, but…

00:05:28.733 --> 00:05:30.401
Oh!

00:05:30.568 --> 00:05:32.737
Stop being so stoic, Stoick!

00:05:32.904 --> 00:05:34.072
Go on.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:37.158
Shout, scream, say something!

00:05:41.663 --> 00:05:45.250
You're as beautiful as the day I lost you.

